      "text": "<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Early recovery at Week 6 was demonstrated in the InSpace group, as characterized by improvement in the ASES (figure 1), ROM (figure 2) and Constant (figure 3) scores:</span><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
